{"v":4,"catch":"一個愚蠢的家庭故事。\n著名的探索恐怖遊戲，\nNintendo Switch重製版登場。","desc":"本作的女主角是一個11歲的女孩，阿雅·德雷維斯。\n某天在德雷維斯的大宅裡，\n突然發生了異變而揭開這家族秘密的恐怖冒險遊戲。\n為了查明真相，\n利用鏈鋸，菜刀，以及帶有眼球的瓶子等道具。\n最可怕的是玩家必須探索這座瘋狂的大宅。\n本作是《Mad Father》的重製版，\n遊戲更新後圖形質量已提升，\n添加了多個事件和場景的變化。\n也添加了第二周目的“BLOOD模式”。","publisher":"PLAYISM","release":"2021-04-08","genres":["冒險","益智","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/77cabb0eeec1067fbe15cb751613c018b1c83d11703ab897c27f67b60a046bbf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/61faa0f8c24c5b7179c046d936bc0c845059636e7aad82ff2a51e8d33cb699b7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0332daa5970d2f12412d2158ccad5c0b0ac01a35a51a3c8e407ccf2777e96ba1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/61f50ebbdbc670e51ea5c5f0a2f67f788a865a398d4b164681f88d00aa7b55f7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0d6a8262153118141e63fabf081fc4a4d3c1fbb52df9ab7c3a137a7c0871c87c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8a264ddb1705069c6bc1c4913d8ee3cc76507e1695124e9a4ce5ab6ee237e4ec.jpg"],"titleId":"01005e7013476000","dlc":[]}